+# Evidence Boundary
+
+All v3.0 capabilities remain D3 / I0. Documentation establishes intended rules but does not prove scale, performance, networking, AI coordination, political legibility, player enjoyment, or institutional safety.
+
+## Registry Maxim
+
+> **The Protectorate enters canon only when every concentration of power remains attached to a traceable charter, a bounded purpose, material capacity, people who can refuse, and civilians who can review what was done in their name.**
