+# Promotion Order
+
+```text
+one chartered local unit
+→ one material mobilization
+→ two-unit interoperability
+→ scoped coalition command
+→ refusal and civilian review
+→ convoy and recovery
+→ multirole Protectorate carrier
+→ strategic compression
+→ twenty-thousand-unit benchmark
+```
+
+# Current Decision
+
+All v3.0 behavior remains **D3 / I0**, except strategic scale and performance budgeting, which remain **D2 / I0** until executable profiling supplies credible envelopes.
+
+No claim may state that Symtropy supports a federated Protectorate until at least one local unit, one coalition, one refusal case, one logistics crisis, and one demobilization pass together in an integrated prototype.
+
+## Readiness Maxim
+
+> **The Protectorate is not ready when twenty thousand unit records load. It is ready when scale does not erase why each unit exists, who it serves, what it can do, and who can stop it.**
